WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.275
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:03.545 --> 00:06.837
Hey, Ueno, what kind of food do you like?

3
00:11.094 --> 00:12.514
Why do you ask?

4
00:12.597 --> 00:15.234
The guys from our hiring batch are grabbing drinks soon.

5
00:15.317 --> 00:17.117
Just trying to figure out where we should go.

6
00:18.217 --> 00:19.517
Oh...

7
00:22.564 --> 00:24.124
I'm not going, so don't worry about me.

8
00:25.397 --> 00:26.534
Anyway.

9
00:26.617 --> 00:27.917
I'm heading out.

10
00:29.477 --> 00:31.006
Oh, wait up!

11
00:32.137 --> 00:33.617
Let's walk out together.

12
00:41.457 --> 00:42.954
Hey, listen.

13
00:43.037 --> 00:47.817
When I crashed at your place last time, what brand was that toner you used?

14
00:49.217 --> 00:51.714
Just some basic drugstore brand.

15
00:51.797 --> 00:53.354
Oh, really?

16
00:53.437 --> 00:55.734
You seem to know a lot about skincare.

17
00:55.817 --> 00:57.197
Got any recommendations?

18
00:58.857 --> 01:01.517
I'm not great at talking about myself.

19
01:02.637 --> 01:05.877
And I hate it when people pry into my personal life.

20
01:14.957 --> 01:16.917
When's your birthday, Ueno?

21
01:33.857 --> 01:35.557
What kind of music do you listen to?

22
01:41.637 --> 01:43.757
What do you do on your days off?

23
01:45.177 --> 01:47.394
Does he actually care?

24
01:47.477 --> 01:48.777
About all that stuff?

25
01:49.837 --> 01:53.777
If he found out I was gay, that'd probably shut him right up.

26
02:00.597 --> 02:01.897
Hey, so...

27
02:02.957 --> 02:04.257
That guy you're looking for...

28
02:05.017 --> 02:06.417
Why can't it be me?

29
02:08.417 --> 02:09.717
Just throwing it out there...

30
02:15.477 --> 02:16.777
Huh?

31
02:17.317 --> 02:18.617
I mean,

32
02:19.237 --> 02:21.317
if you're looking for someone like that,

33
02:21.877 --> 02:23.517
wouldn't it be way easier with me?

34
02:24.977 --> 02:26.234
Wait...

35
02:26.317 --> 02:27.394
Hold on.

36
02:27.477 --> 02:28.957
Where is this coming from?

37
02:29.577 --> 02:31.754
Instead of swiping on dating apps...

38
02:31.837 --> 02:33.137
Look, I...

39
02:34.677 --> 02:36.517
I like you.

40
02:38.557 --> 02:40.017
So, what do you say?

41
02:42.617 --> 02:44.017
You say you like me...

42
02:45.517 --> 02:46.817
Wait, you mean...

43
02:49.417 --> 02:51.334
Wait, do you...

44
02:51.417 --> 02:53.074
not find me attractive at all?

45
02:53.157 --> 02:54.514
Am I not your type?

46
02:54.597 --> 02:55.734
No,

47
02:55.817 --> 02:57.437
that's beside the point.

48
02:59.721 --> 03:01.849
You're moving way too fast.

49
03:01.932 --> 03:04.893
Just drink some water and cool off...

50
03:07.377 --> 03:08.594
What are you doing?

51
03:08.677 --> 03:09.977
Sorry.

52
03:13.897 --> 03:15.197
Still,

53
03:18.407 --> 03:19.800
in your eyes, Ueno...

54
03:23.657 --> 03:25.497
do I stand a chance?

55
03:28.057 --> 03:29.357
Or is it a hard pass?

56
03:34.717 --> 03:37.008
You're not even gay.

57
03:38.917 --> 03:40.887
Do you really want to know the answer?

58
03:44.933 --> 03:46.226
Yeah, I do.

59
04:00.537 --> 04:01.837
God...

60
04:02.377 --> 04:03.817
I'm so into him.

61
04:07.497 --> 04:08.934
I think

62
04:09.017 --> 04:10.757
I always have been.

63
04:15.237 --> 04:17.334
Wait, with two guys...

64
04:17.417 --> 04:18.717
how does this even work?

65
04:20.297 --> 04:21.597
Hey.

66
04:22.554 --> 04:24.222
Get off me first...

67
04:25.277 --> 04:26.577
Screw it.

68
04:27.097 --> 04:28.397
I don't even care anymore.

69
04:34.197 --> 04:35.497
Wait...

70
04:36.157 --> 04:37.457
Hold on!

71
04:55.045 --> 04:56.296
Hey!

72
05:13.037 --> 05:14.998
Not half bad, right?

73
05:39.339 --> 05:40.966
Ueno...

74
05:59.359 --> 06:03.154
That wasn't a dream, right?

75
06:04.781 --> 06:06.950
When he held me tight,

76
06:07.857 --> 06:10.717
it felt like he wanted me with everything he had.

77
06:11.837 --> 06:16.001
And I realized, this is all I've ever wanted.

78
06:18.557 --> 06:21.217
So this is what it feels like to let your guard down with someone.

79
06:26.970 --> 06:29.117
Ow...

80
06:34.394 --> 06:35.854
(Shirai: Kanda-san!!!!! )

81
06:35.937 --> 06:37.817
(I got a winning stick on my kinako candy!!!! )

82
06:41.776 --> 06:44.154
Why are you telling me?!

83
06:51.661 --> 06:53.674
(Ueno: What happened? Where are you?)

84
06:53.757 --> 06:55.057
After that,

85
06:56.373 --> 06:59.813
I pretty much just left without saying much.

86
07:02.631 --> 07:04.999
I wonder what's going through his head.

87
08:30.300 --> 08:32.900
"You Should Be The One To Come Kiss Me"

88
08:33.763 --> 08:37.857
(Episode 5 )

89
08:48.194 --> 08:49.194
Man...

90
08:53.153 --> 08:54.453
Ugh...

91
08:56.257 --> 08:57.912
Ugh!

92
08:58.817 --> 09:00.717
Maybe I should just call it a day and go home.

93
09:01.557 --> 09:02.694
Sounds like a plan.

94
09:02.777 --> 09:03.777
Mind if I tag along?

95
09:03.857 --> 09:05.157
Not a chance.

96
09:05.737 --> 09:08.799
You still haven't given me the handouts for tomorrow's meeting.

97
09:08.882 --> 09:11.254
Working on it as fast as I can!

98
09:11.337 --> 09:14.954
Actually, I'm still waiting on the list of questions from PR.

99
09:15.037 --> 09:16.337
Why are we waiting on PR?

100
09:17.617 --> 09:20.957
Since it involves the local government, Mizoguchi-san is joining us tomorrow.

101
09:22.617 --> 09:24.337
Didn't we just go over this in the morning?

102
09:24.917 --> 09:26.217
Oh.

103
09:27.067 --> 09:28.360
Right.

104
09:28.443 --> 09:30.234
Yeah, rings a bell.

105
09:30.317 --> 09:31.334
My bad.

106
09:31.417 --> 09:33.714
I'm gonna go grab some lunch.

107
09:33.797 --> 09:35.097
Huh?

108
09:37.517 --> 09:38.817
Kanda-san?

109
10:09.957 --> 10:10.894
Excuse me.

110
10:10.977 --> 10:13.117
Could I send this document back for revision?

111
10:17.826 --> 10:19.417
Guess he's tied up.

112
10:29.117 --> 10:30.714
Kanda-san.

113
10:30.797 --> 10:32.097
Wanna eat together?

114
10:32.717 --> 10:34.017
Sure.

115
10:38.577 --> 10:39.877
Thanks.

116
10:42.617 --> 10:44.770
Man...

117
10:44.853 --> 10:47.957
General Affairs sent out a company-wide email.

118
10:49.237 --> 10:51.397
Why hasn't he texted me at all?

119
10:52.277 --> 10:53.997
Not that I've reached out either.

120
10:54.817 --> 10:57.194
Still, after everything that happened...

121
10:57.277 --> 10:58.577
Normally, you'd...

122
11:02.717 --> 11:03.934
Did you go all the way?

123
11:04.017 --> 11:05.874
No!

124
11:05.957 --> 11:07.274
I knew it.

125
11:07.357 --> 11:10.114
That survey is way too long, right?

126
11:10.197 --> 11:11.894
I gave up halfway through, too.

127
11:11.977 --> 11:13.957
Oh, you meant that.

128
11:18.057 --> 11:19.657
Wait, are we just friends with benefits?

129
11:20.805 --> 11:22.098
Am I just a hookup to him?

130
11:22.724 --> 11:25.597
I mean, I did make it sound like I was fine just being a stand-in.

131
11:27.857 --> 11:29.157
Hey, guess what?

132
11:29.697 --> 11:30.997
On my next day off,

133
11:31.757 --> 11:34.986
I'm hanging out with my crush.

134
11:41.657 --> 11:42.997
No appetite?

135
11:43.637 --> 11:45.897
If you're not gonna eat that, I'll take it.

136
11:47.457 --> 11:49.751
Oh...

137
11:49.834 --> 11:52.003
Yeah, go ahead...

138
12:36.339 --> 12:37.632
Whoa, stop...

139
12:38.637 --> 12:40.385
You're creeping me out.

140
12:50.857 --> 12:53.134
- Let's get omurice. - Oh, sounds good.

141
12:53.217 --> 12:55.494
I'm craving Italian today.

142
12:55.577 --> 12:56.276
Ooh, that works too.

143
12:56.359 --> 12:59.571
I wanna take lots of cute pics.

144
12:59.654 --> 13:02.115
Let's find somewhere trendy...

145
13:06.837 --> 13:08.114
Oh.

146
13:08.197 --> 13:09.374
Sorry!

147
13:09.457 --> 13:11.034
My last meeting ran way over.

148
13:11.117 --> 13:12.977
We're short on time, so I went ahead and called a cab.

149
13:13.001 --> 13:14.335
Awesome, you're a lifesaver.

150
13:17.037 --> 13:18.337
Oh.

151
13:19.132 --> 13:21.954
Mind if I ride shotgun?

152
13:22.037 --> 13:23.914
I'll hop in the back then.

153
13:23.997 --> 13:25.297
Sure.

154
13:27.517 --> 13:29.017
You don't have to do that.

155
13:34.317 --> 13:35.817
Force of habit...

156
13:42.317 --> 13:43.094
All right.

157
13:43.177 --> 13:47.577
I also brought Mizoguchi from our PR department today.

158
13:47.660 --> 13:49.314
Allow me to introduce her.

159
13:49.397 --> 13:51.454
May I introduce myself?

160
13:51.537 --> 13:52.254
Please, go ahead.

161
13:52.337 --> 13:53.697
It's a pleasure to meet you.

162
13:55.397 --> 13:57.394
Heading back to the office too, Kanda-san?

163
13:57.477 --> 14:00.374
No, I have to swing by Lanau Corp next.

164
14:00.457 --> 14:01.817
You two go on ahead.

165
14:02.617 --> 14:04.635
Rough schedule.

166
14:10.757 --> 14:12.354
Hey, quick question.

167
14:12.437 --> 14:14.080
That ex you slept with before making it official...

168
14:14.105 --> 14:17.162
how long did it take for you guys to actually start dating?

169
14:17.437 --> 14:18.737
Whoa, where is this coming from?

170
14:21.037 --> 14:22.437
Well, let's see...

171
14:25.037 --> 14:28.052
Not really a topic for broad daylight in the middle of the business district.

172
14:28.076 --> 14:30.174
Save it for our next drinks.

173
14:30.257 --> 14:32.454
Oh, right, sorry!

174
14:32.537 --> 14:33.694
How about tonight...

175
14:33.777 --> 14:37.857
No good, I've got another work dinner tomorrow.

176
14:39.137 --> 14:40.294
I'll text you.

177
14:40.377 --> 14:41.274
Got it.

178
14:41.357 --> 14:43.034
Anyway, good work today, you two.

179
14:43.117 --> 14:43.834
See ya.

180
14:43.917 --> 14:45.217
Good work today.

181
14:51.557 --> 14:53.117
You totally heard all that, didn't you?

182
14:54.617 --> 14:56.117
Loud and clear.

183
14:58.477 --> 15:00.291
Boy's losing his cool.

184
15:06.717 --> 15:08.449
Didn't you say we should stay out of it?

185
15:12.657 --> 15:15.290
Yeah, I know, I know.

186
15:15.373 --> 15:18.997
I just really hope Kanda-san doesn't get his heart broken.

187
15:21.657 --> 15:23.437
Since when did you get so soft?

188
15:24.657 --> 15:26.617
Unlike me, he seems pretty sensitive.

189
15:30.917 --> 15:32.394
Don't sweat it.

190
15:32.477 --> 15:35.894
If he ends up in tears, I'll give him a shoulder to cry on.

191
15:35.977 --> 15:38.857
Damn, Mizoguchi-san, you're such a badass.

192
15:40.197 --> 15:42.517
Yeah, right.

193
15:43.357 --> 15:47.814
Looking at Kanda right now reminds me of my younger self. It's painful to watch.

194
15:47.897 --> 15:51.597
I honestly can't picture you being anything less than cool, Mizoguchi-san.

195
15:53.797 --> 15:55.937
Let's keep it that way.

196
16:22.037 --> 16:25.777
At first, I didn't think Kanda and I would get along at all.

197
16:27.361 --> 16:28.654
Whether it was our mindset,

198
16:29.217 --> 16:31.337
or the way we communicate.

199
16:36.937 --> 16:39.414
Whatever happened to grabbing drinks with our batch?

200
16:39.497 --> 16:40.794
Oh.

201
16:40.877 --> 16:42.754
We're just waiting on Ueno, right?

202
16:42.837 --> 16:44.462
Ah, Ueno...

203
16:44.545 --> 16:48.087
Stop bugging him. The guy's running out of excuses to turn us down.

204
16:48.112 --> 16:50.937
True, it just makes things awkward for everyone.

205
16:51.497 --> 16:53.317
I don't think it's a big deal.

206
16:53.997 --> 16:54.714
Huh?

207
16:54.797 --> 16:56.734
What do you mean?

208
16:56.817 --> 16:58.117
Well...

209
16:59.393 --> 17:00.833
I don't know him all that well yet, either.

210
17:00.857 --> 17:01.874
Come on, what gives?

211
17:01.957 --> 17:04.173
He's not a bad guy, though.

212
17:04.196 --> 17:05.496
He's really kind,

213
17:06.377 --> 17:08.496
and pretty deep once you get talking to him.

214
17:09.516 --> 17:11.316
There's just something interesting about him.

215
17:11.617 --> 17:14.217
The more you get to know him, the more you want to find out.

216
17:15.397 --> 17:17.774
That trait really makes you a natural for sales, Kanda.

217
17:17.857 --> 17:18.574
What trait?

218
17:18.657 --> 17:20.373
You want to get to know me?

219
17:21.040 --> 17:22.333
For real?

220
17:24.477 --> 17:25.777
Even though...

221
17:28.297 --> 17:30.837
Actually, I'm gay.

222
17:38.137 --> 17:39.437
You actually showed up?

223
17:40.417 --> 17:41.717
Is that a problem?

224
17:44.063 --> 17:46.140
Not really.

225
17:58.417 --> 18:00.094
Hey, check this out.

226
18:00.177 --> 18:01.597
This is hilarious.

227
18:15.677 --> 18:17.263
Before I knew it,

228
18:18.764 --> 18:20.491
he became someone special to me.

229
18:37.917 --> 18:39.637
Oh, sorry.

230
18:47.077 --> 18:49.645
We need to talk.

231
18:59.317 --> 19:01.617
I'm sorry about what happened the other day.

232
19:04.757 --> 19:06.134
Well...

233
19:06.217 --> 19:07.517
How do I put this?

234
19:09.023 --> 19:10.750
I'm gay,

235
19:11.617 --> 19:13.017
and I have physical urges, too.

236
19:13.957 --> 19:17.677
When a guy I trust touches me, my body just reacts naturally.

237
19:19.977 --> 19:21.477
But I don't want us to start dating

238
19:22.077 --> 19:24.317
just because we got caught up in the heat of the moment.

239
19:28.217 --> 19:29.794
Because to me,

240
19:29.877 --> 19:31.877
you really matter.

241
19:32.417 --> 19:34.217
I want us to be friends for life.

242
19:39.737 --> 19:41.037
So...

243
19:43.277 --> 19:44.677
Can we just pretend

244
19:45.237 --> 19:47.077
that night never happened?

245
19:56.877 --> 19:58.177
I see.

246
20:06.577 --> 20:07.877
Got it.

247
20:09.542 --> 20:13.017
Sorry you felt like you had to go along with me.

248
20:14.797 --> 20:16.097
That's not...

249
20:17.049 --> 20:20.817
I really do like you.

250
20:22.537 --> 20:24.457
I honestly thought we might have a shot.

251
20:29.797 --> 20:31.797
Guess things aren't that simple, huh?

252
20:36.337 --> 20:38.877
Anyway, I'm gonna head out for today.

253
20:59.337 --> 21:00.637
Oh, right.

254
21:02.177 --> 21:04.277
Here, take this back.

255
21:06.873 --> 21:08.273
Wait, what?

256
21:26.952 --> 21:30.237
Let's just keep things normal starting tomorrow, okay?

257
21:53.597 --> 21:55.597
I figured if it was Ueno, we could make this work.

258
22:00.277 --> 22:02.279
Maybe

259
22:04.865 --> 22:07.993
if we just stay friends,

260
22:08.697 --> 22:10.357
everything will be fine.

261
23:36.717 --> 23:37.717
Oh.

262
23:39.043 --> 23:40.920
That's the thing Ueno has at his place.

263
23:41.003 --> 23:42.439
(Trending on social media: Moving Sand Art)

264
23:42.463 --> 23:44.303
(Every flip creates a one-of-a-kind landscape)

265
23:51.857 --> 23:55.217
How am I supposed to just act like normal friends?

266
23:59.697 --> 24:02.293
(Next Episode Preview) He's going to run himself into the ground at this rate.

267
24:02.317 --> 24:03.954
You can come over to my place anytime.

268
24:04.037 --> 24:05.413
I'll give you the spare key back, too.

269
24:05.437 --> 24:07.446
Didn't I tell you I don't need it anymore?

270
24:07.529 --> 24:09.517
I want to understand Kanda.

271
24:10.377 --> 24:11.450
But...

272
24:11.533 --> 24:14.053
I'm still terrified.
